{"version":1,"id":"fiona-apple-sleep-to-dream","title":"Sleep To Dream","artist":"Fiona Apple","key":"Eb","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/fiona-apple/sleep-to-dream/?instrument=keyboard","spotifyUrl":"https://open.spotify.com/track/51HiIbv8gO0HvwpmAxXAFe","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Apple Fiona","chords":[{"symbol":"C","canonical":"C","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,4,7],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Bb7","canonical":"Bb7","keyboardPitchClasses":[10,2,5,8],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"A7","canonical":"A7","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,1,4,7],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Eb","canonical":"Eb","keyboardPitchClasses":[3,7,10],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D","canonical":"D","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Ab","canonical":"Ab","keyboardPitchClasses":[8,0,3],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"I tell you how I feel, but you don't care","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"I say tell me the truth, but you don't dare","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"You say love is a hell you cannot bear","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"And I say gimme mine back and go there - for all I care","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"I got my feet on the ground and I don't go to sleep to dream","columns":60,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb7","column":15,"beat":2},{"symbol":"A7","column":31,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"You got your head in the clouds and you're not at all what you seem","columns":67,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb7","column":11,"beat":2},{"symbol":"A7","column":33,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"This mind, this body, and this voice cannot be stiffled by your deviant ways","columns":76,"beats":7,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb7","column":20,"beat":1},{"symbol":"A7","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"So don't forget what I told you, don't come around, I got my own hell to raise","columns":78,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb7","column":18,"beat":2},{"symbol":"A7","column":42,"beat":5}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"I have never been so insulted in all my life","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"I could swallow the seas to wash down all this pride","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"First you run like a fool just to be by my side","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"And now you run like a fool, but you just run to hide, I can't abide","columns":68,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"section","text":"CHORUS","columns":6,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Don't make it a big deal, don't be so sensitive","columns":47,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Eb","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":14,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Eb","column":27,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"We're not playing a game anymore; you don't have to be so defensive","columns":67,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Eb","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":17,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Ab","column":42,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"Don't you plead me your case, don't bother to explain","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Don't even show me your face, 'cuz it's a crying shame","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"Just go back to the rock from under which you came","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Take the sorrow you gave and all the stakes you claim","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"And don't forget the blame","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"section","text":"CHORUS","columns":6,"beats":0,"changes":[]}]}